+NOTES = r"""
+Section 1 fixes the exact object: F_{a,b,c}(x,y,z) is the sum of the
+three displayed floors, with x,y,z integral.  Equation (1.2) is the key exact
+transformation: if a=s(a)t^2, then floor((tx)^2/a)=floor(x^2/s(a)).
